{
  "id": "emissions_from_the_human_body",
  "title": "Emissions from the Human Body",
  "description": "Gaseous pollutants emissions from human bodies",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Gaseous Emissions from the Human Body\n\nTypical gaseous emissions rates from human bodies:\n\n- **Acetaldehyde**: 3.5×10⁻⁸ g/h\n- **Acetone**: 4.8×10⁻⁷ g/h\n- **Ammonia**: 1.6×10⁻⁵ g/h\n- **Carbon dioxide**: 3.2×10⁻² g/h\n- **Carbon monoxide**: 1×10⁻⁵ g/h\n- **Hydrogen sulfide**: 1.5×10⁻⁸ g/h\n- **Methane**: 1.7×10⁻⁶ g/h\n- **Methanol**: 6×10⁻⁹ g/h\n- **Toluene**: 2.3×10⁻⁸ g/h\n\n**Unit Conversion**: 1 g/h = 1×10⁻³ kg/h = 2.2×10⁻³ lb/h"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "duration_hours",
          "label": "Duration",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 24,
          "unit": "hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "num_people",
          "label": "Number of People",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "people"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "acetaldehyde_total",
          "label": "Acetaldehyde",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 3.5e-8",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "acetone_total",
          "label": "Acetone",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 4.8e-7",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "ammonia_total",
          "label": "Ammonia",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 1.6e-5",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "co2_total",
          "label": "Carbon dioxide",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 3.2e-2",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "co_total",
          "label": "Carbon monoxide",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 1e-5",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "h2s_total",
          "label": "Hydrogen sulfide",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 1.5e-8",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "methane_total",
          "label": "Methane",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 1.7e-6",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "methanol_total",
          "label": "Methanol",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 6e-9",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "toluene_total",
          "label": "Toluene",
          "formula": "inputs.duration_hours * inputs.num_people * 2.3e-8",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "scientific"
        }
      ]
    },
